@host = http://localhost:5080

### Crear orden
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-001

{
  "patientId": "12345",
  "patientName": "Juan Perez",
  "serviceCode": "LAB001",
  "serviceDescription": "Hemograma",
  "priority": "Normal"
}

### Crear orden urgente
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "67890",
  "patientName": "Maria Gomez",
  "serviceCode": "IMG010",
  "serviceDescription": "Radiografía de tórax",
  "priority": "Urgente"
}

### Orden inválida (400): falta patientId y prioridad incorrecta
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serviceCode": "LAB001", "priority": "Alta" }

### Listar (con filtros y paginación)
GET {{host}}/api/orders?status=Pendiente&page=1&pageSize=10

###
GET {{host}}/api/orders?patientId=12345

### Detalle (reemplaza el id)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1a136f8b-857e-450f-96ea-6bd83e74f6f1

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
